Field Type:
    - Fixed
    - Variable 
    - Compact
        - Prepended with a size byte 
        - Byte size decoding
            - byte size <= 00-FC (0-252)    -> 1 byte  (num)
            - byte size == FD (253)         -> 2 bytes (prefix+num)
            - byte size == FE (254)         -> 4 bytes (prefix+num)
            - byte size == FF (255)         -> 8 bytes (prefix+num)

Bitcoin Core Networks
    - Mainnet
        - Public production network  
    - Testnet
        - Public preproduction testing (qa) network
    - Regnet
        - Private development and local testing network

Endianess:
    - The order of bytes
    - Big Endianess
        - Forward order of bytes
    - Little Endianess
        - Reverse order of bytes
